Module parity.syntax.resultIsEn.

Rule sign given x as Int, produce Int:
  If x is greater than 0:
    The result is 1.
  If x is less than 0:
		the result is	2.
  THE RESULT IS 0.

Rule label given x as Int, produce Int:
  Match x:
    When 1, the result is 10.
    When 2,The Result Is 20.
    When y,
      the result is y.

Rule echo, produce Text:
  The result is "The result is kept".
